 then i provide my information  once my customer is created i can log in  by providing username and password  and i've successfully logged in back in  my editor i can see the new user that  was entered from the application  fantastic it didn't take long to get my  simple application interacting with the  spanner emulator  this is great for getting my feet wet  with spanner but soon i will need other  developers to collaborate on this  application and for that i will need to  create an actual spanner instance  in the next video i will go over what a  spanner instance is and the different  options for creating one in the meantime  go ahead and try out the spanner  emulator for yourself and let us know in  the comments your experience  [Music]  you
 

